    {
        "id": 7,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  星熊？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "星熊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  啊？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "啊？"
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你脸色不大好。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你脸色不大好。"
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我没事，只是在想事情。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我没事，只是在想事情。"
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] ......我没想到他会被卷进来。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "......我没想到他会被卷进来。"
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  没事，你知道我的。过去的都过去了，用龙门话来说，这是命。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "没事，你知道我的。过去的都过去了，用龙门话来说，这是命。"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 东国人也会信这个？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "东国人也会信这个？"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  经历这么了这么多事，即使我不信，现在也已经认了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "经历这么了这么多事，即使我不信，现在也已经认了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  线报没问题吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "线报没问题吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"] 准确无误。这里就是线报记载的位置了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "准确无误。这里就是线报记载的位置了。"
    },
