    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我们的目标，是那些鬼鬼祟祟的整合运动吗？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我们的目标，是那些鬼鬼祟祟的整合运动吗？"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  看来他们没发现我们，还不知道近卫局已经把他们彻底包围了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "看来他们没发现我们，还不知道近卫局已经把他们彻底包围了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  似乎在围绕着整座街区搭建着什么的样子。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "似乎在围绕着整座街区搭建着什么的样子。"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  不出意外的话，这里是连接着整合运动各个据点的中心枢纽之一。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "不出意外的话，这里是连接着整合运动各个据点的中心枢纽之一。"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我们摧毁这里的通讯收发设施，可以狠狠地打击整个区域内的敌人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我们摧毁这里的通讯收发设施，可以狠狠地打击整个区域内的敌人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  这能增添我们最后反攻近卫局大楼的胜算。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "这能增添我们最后反攻近卫局大楼的胜算。"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  都听你的。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "都听你的。"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  而且，我也很在意情报线索的细节内容。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "而且，我也很在意情报线索的细节内容。"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  你是说，整合运动在这儿活动，可不单单是想建个还算牢靠的据点，是吧？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "你是说，整合运动在这儿活动，可不单单是想建个还算牢靠的据点，是吧？"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  你猜对了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "你猜对了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  “敌人正秘密寻找高价值目标，需优先确认其行动。”",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "“敌人正秘密寻找高价值目标，需优先确认其行动。”"
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  他们在富人区干些什么？这能有什么高价值目标？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "他们在富人区干些什么？这能有什么高价值目标？"
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  我也觉得有问题。按照之前的计划，这条街道上的任何建筑都应当空无一人。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "我也觉得有问题。按照之前的计划，这条街道上的任何建筑都应当空无一人。"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  如果整合运动是在预谋绑架谁，那他们可能没机会抓住这位幸运市民了。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "如果整合运动是在预谋绑架谁，那他们可能没机会抓住这位幸运市民了。"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#5\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  我们什么时候动手？整合运动似乎不喜欢布置侦查小队，我们随时可以突袭他们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "我们什么时候动手？整合运动似乎不喜欢布置侦查小队，我们随时可以突袭他们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  一直在做猎人，从来没做过猎物吧。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "一直在做猎人，从来没做过猎物吧。"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 61,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  这时候成为猎物，马上就会没命。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "这时候成为猎物，马上就会没命。"
    },
    {
        "id": 62,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  还是先仔细观察一下。我们要优先确认敌人的目的，却不是要折腾他们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "还是先仔细观察一下。我们要优先确认敌人的目的，却不是要折腾他们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 63,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 64,
        "raw": "[name=\"陈\"]  摧毁目标轻而易举，想要了解敌人的目标却需要我们的耐心。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "陈",
        "content": "摧毁目标轻而易举，想要了解敌人的目标却需要我们的耐心。"
    },
    {
        "id": 65,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_136_hsguma\",name2=\"char_010_chen_1#1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma.png",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 66,
        "raw": "[name=\"星熊\"]  明白。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "星熊",
        "content": "明白。"
    },
